cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "CalmWindPatches: Detection and analysis of oceanic calm-wind patches"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Maor"
    given-names: "Sagi"

version: 1.0.0

repository-code: "https://github.com/SagiMaor/CalmWindPatches"

license: MIT

abstract: >
  Python code for the detection, tracking, characterization, and analysis
  of oceanic calm-wind patches using AMSR2 satellite observations and
  ERA5 reanalysis. The repository includes data-processing scripts and
  scripts used to generate the analyses and figures associated with the
  study.
